    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-2493 open-field suite OF4 - on basic-desert's open field, 'Blue Platoon' (3 squads of 5) bounds east across it (PlatoonBound: support point (150,510), objective (400,510)); a 3-man 'Red Squad' fire team in a tree clump north of the field (230,600; sandbags, SquadHold) opens fire on the nearest squad from ~80 m. Judge: react to contact at PLATOON level (ATP 3-21.8): the squad in contact returns fire and gets into cover; the platoon does NOT freeze - another squad moves to support or to the flank, and the fire team is beaten within 300 s. Fail: every Blue man still a minute while Red still fights (the whole platoon holding), or the fire team never beaten. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh of-platoon-flank-contact"
